{"seq":1,"slug":"variables-types","title":"变量与类型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/powershell-automation/language/variables-types","wordCount":1225,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"变量与类型\">变量与类型</h1><p><code>$x = 42</code> 在 PowerShell 里看起来和任何脚本语言一样朴素，但当你写 <code>$x.GetType().FullName</code> 会发现它是 <code>System.Int32</code>——一个货真价实的 .NET 整数类型，而不是某种语言私有的「数字」。这一点决定了 PowerShell 变量的全部行为：它们承载的是 .NET 对象，于是你能调对象的方法、用 .NET 的类型字面量去约束变量、依赖 .NET 的自动类型转换。这一篇讲 PowerShell 变量的声明与作用域、它如何借用 .NET 类型系统、以及类型加速器与转换规则——这是兑现「<a href=\"../foundations/object-pipeline\">对象管道</a>」承诺的语言层基础。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-变量是-net-对象的具名引用\">核心概念：变量是 .NET 对象的具名引用</h2><p>变量以 <code>$</code> 开头，无需先声明即可赋值，默认动态类型——同一个变量可以先存整数再存字符串。但「动态」不等于「无类型」：每次赋值后，变量持有的值都有确切的 .NET 类型。下图展示一个赋值的内部形态。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;$d = Get-Date&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;右侧求值&lt;br/&gt;产出 DateTime 实例&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;变量 $d 绑定到该对象引用&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;$d.Year 读属性&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; E[&quot;$d.AddDays(7) 调方法&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; F[&quot;$d.GetType() 反射类型&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; G[&quot;都作用在真实 .NET 对象上&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; G&#10;    F --&gt; G\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"$d = Get-Date\"] --&gt; B[\"右侧求值&lt;br/&gt;产出 DateTime 实例\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"变量 $d 绑定到该对象引用\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"$d.Year 读属性\"]\n    C --&gt; E[\"$d.AddDays(7) 调方法\"]\n    C --&gt; F[\"$d.GetType() 反射类型\"]\n    D --&gt; G[\"都作用在真实 .NET 对象上\"]\n    E --&gt; G\n    F --&gt; G</pre><p>因为变量引用的是真实对象，<code>$d.AddDays(7)</code> 这种「值即对象、对象有行为」的写法贯穿全语言。变量本身也通过 <code>Variable:</code> 提供程序暴露成可遍历的驱动器，这一点见「<a href=\"../foundations/providers-drives\">提供程序与驱动器</a>」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"强类型约束-类型字面量\">强类型约束：类型字面量</h2><p>虽然默认动态，但你可以用方括号类型字面量给变量上强约束，之后该变量只接受能转换成该类型的值：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"powershell\" data-code=\"[int]$count = 10&#10;$count = &#39;25&#39;          # 字符串 &#39;25&#39; 被自动转换为 Int32 25&#10;$count = &#39;abc&#39;         # 抛出转换异常——强类型守住了边界&#10;[datetime]$start = &#39;2026-06-30&#39;   # 字符串被解析为 DateTime\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>[int]$count = 10</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>$count = '25'          # 字符串 '25' 被自动转换为 Int32 25</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>$count = 'abc'         # 抛出转换异常——强类型守住了边界</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[datetime]$start = '2026-06-30'   # 字符串被解析为 DateTime</span></span></code></pre></div><p>强类型变量在写健壮脚本时极有价值：参数若声明为 <code>[int]</code>，传入的字符串会被自动转换或在无法转换时及早报错，把「类型错误」挡在边界上而非深入逻辑后才爆炸。这种「边界处解析、内部信任类型」的思路，正是参数验证的基础，详见「<a href=\"functions-scripts\">函数与脚本</a>」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"自动类型转换与字节量后缀\">自动类型转换与字节量后缀</h2><p>PowerShell 在赋值、比较、参数绑定时会尝试自动转换类型，规则相当激进。下表列出几类常见的隐式转换，理解它们能避免一类隐蔽 bug。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>表达式</th>\n<th>结果类型</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>&#39;5&#39; + 3</code></td>\n<td>String <code>&#39;53&#39;</code></td>\n<td>左操作数定调，字符串拼接</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>5 + &#39;3&#39;</code></td>\n<td>Int32 <code>8</code></td>\n<td>左操作数定调，数值相加</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>[int]&#39;0x1F&#39;</code></td>\n<td>Int32 <code>31</code></td>\n<td>十六进制字符串识别</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>[bool]&#39;false&#39;</code></td>\n<td><code>$true</code></td>\n<td>非空字符串即真——经典陷阱</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>1GB</code></td>\n<td>Int64 <code>1073741824</code></td>\n<td>字节量后缀 KB/MB/GB/TB/PB</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><code>[bool]&#39;false&#39;</code> 返回 <code>$true</code> 是新手常踩的坑：任何非空字符串转布尔都为真，要判断字符串内容须显式比较 <code>$s -eq &#39;true&#39;</code>。字节量后缀（<code>1MB</code>、<code>1GB</code>）则极其实用，前文计算内存的 <code>$_.WorkingSet / 1MB</code> 就是它。</p>\n<h2 id=\"类型加速器-net-类型的简写\">类型加速器：.NET 类型的简写</h2><p>PowerShell 给常用 .NET 类型提供了短别名，叫类型加速器：<code>[string]</code> → <code>System.String</code>，<code>[int]</code> → <code>System.Int32</code>，<code>[regex]</code> → <code>System.Text.RegularExpressions.Regex</code>，<code>[xml]</code>、<code>[hashtable]</code>、<code>[pscustomobject]</code> 等。它们既能约束变量，也能直接当构造器或静态方法入口用：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"powershell\" data-code=\"[regex]::Matches(&#39;a1b2c3&#39;, &#39;\\d&#39;)          # 静态方法，找出所有数字&#10;[xml]$config = Get-Content app.config -Raw  # 字符串直接解析成 XML 对象树&#10;$config.configuration.appSettings          # 像访问属性一样遍历 XML&#10;[guid]::NewGuid()                          # 生成 GUID\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>[regex]::Matches('a1b2c3', '\\d')          # 静态方法，找出所有数字</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[xml]$config = Get-Content app.config -Raw  # 字符串直接解析成 XML 对象树</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>$config.configuration.appSettings          # 像访问属性一样遍历 XML</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[guid]::NewGuid()                          # 生成 GUID</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>[pscustomobject]</code> 是构造结构化对象最常用的加速器，配合哈希表能凭空造出带命名属性的对象——这与 <code>Select-Object</code> 的计算属性产出同一类东西，是把数据塑形成对象的主力工具：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"powershell\" data-code=\"$server = [pscustomobject]@{&#10;    Name   = &#39;web01&#39;&#10;    IP     = &#39;10.0.0.5&#39;&#10;    Online = $true&#10;}&#10;$server.Name          # 像访问真实对象属性\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>$server = [pscustomobject]@{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Name   = 'web01'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    IP     = '10.0.0.5'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Online = $true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>$server.Name          # 像访问真实对象属性</span></span></code></pre></div><p>数学运算同样走 .NET：<code>[math]::Sqrt(2)</code>、<code>[math]::Pow(2, 10)</code>。需要写公式时用 KaTeX，例如标准差 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>N</mi></mfrac><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>μ</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma = \\sqrt{\\frac{1}{N}\\sum_{i=1}^{N}(x_i - \\mu)^2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.84em;vertical-align:-0.5369em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3031em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3.8em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.8em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:1em;\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9812em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2631em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.8em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:1.02em;height:1.88em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.88em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1944\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M983 90\nl0 -0\nc4,-6.7,10,-10,18,-10 H400000v40\nH1013.1s-83.4,268,-264.1,840c-180.7,572,-277,876.3,-289,913c-4.7,4.7,-12.7,7,-24,7\ns-12,0,-12,0c-1.3,-3.3,-3.7,-11.7,-7,-25c-35.3,-125.3,-106.7,-373.3,-214,-744\nc-10,12,-21,25,-33,39s-32,39,-32,39c-6,-5.3,-15,-14,-27,-26s25,-30,25,-30\nc26.7,-32.7,52,-63,76,-91s52,-60,52,-60s208,722,208,722\nc56,-175.3,126.3,-397.3,211,-666c84.7,-268.7,153.8,-488.2,207.5,-658.5\nc53.7,-170.3,84.5,-266.8,92.5,-289.5z\nM1001 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5369em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，对应代码可调用 <code>[math]::Sqrt(...)</code> 实现。</p>\n<h2 id=\"作用域-变量在何处可见\">作用域：变量在何处可见</h2><p>PowerShell 的变量有作用域层级：Global（会话级）、Script（脚本文件级）、Local（当前函数/块）。默认读取时向上查找父作用域，写入时在当前作用域新建。可用作用域修饰符显式指定：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"powershell\" data-code=\"$Global:Config = &#39;shared&#39;     # 全局，整个会话可见&#10;function Update {&#10;    $Script:counter++         # 修改脚本级变量而非新建局部&#10;    $local:tmp = &#39;private&#39;     # 仅本函数可见&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>$Global:Config = 'shared'     # 全局，整个会话可见</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function Update {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    $Script:counter++         # 修改脚本级变量而非新建局部</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    $local:tmp = 'private'     # 仅本函数可见</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>理解作用域对写函数与模块至关重要——不经意地依赖父作用域变量是脚本难以维护的常见根源。模块还引入更强的隔离（模块作用域），它让模块内部变量不污染调用者，这一隔离机制是「<a href=\"../automation/modules-gallery\">模块与库</a>」的设计基础。还有一类自动变量由引擎维护：<code>$_</code>/<code>$PSItem</code>（当前管道对象）、<code>$?</code>（上条命令是否成功）、<code>$Error</code>（错误历史）、<code>$PSItem</code>，其中错误相关的自动变量在「<a href=\"error-handling\">错误处理</a>」里展开。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>PowerShell 变量是 .NET 对象的具名引用，默认动态类型但每个值都有确切 .NET 类型，可调用对象方法、反射类型。</li>\n<li>用 <code>[int]</code>、<code>[datetime]</code> 等类型字面量可给变量上强约束，把类型错误挡在边界上；自动类型转换激进（注意 <code>[bool]&#39;false&#39;</code> 为真的陷阱）。</li>\n<li>类型加速器是 .NET 类型的简写，既约束变量也作静态方法入口；<code>[pscustomobject]@{...}</code> 是凭空造结构化对象的主力。</li>\n<li>字节量后缀（<code>1MB</code>/<code>1GB</code>）、<code>[math]::</code> 静态方法让计算贴近 .NET。</li>\n<li>作用域分 Global/Script/Local，读向上查、写在当前建，可用修饰符显式指定；模块提供更强隔离。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"延伸阅读-跨链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨链接</h3><ul>\n<li>这些类型的对象如何在管道里流动 → 见「<a href=\"../foundations/object-pipeline\">对象管道</a>」</li>\n<li>把类型约束用于参数验证 → 见「<a href=\"functions-scripts\">函数与脚本</a>」</li>\n<li>变量通过 <code>Variable:</code> 驱动器暴露的统一抽象 → 见「<a href=\"../foundations/providers-drives\">提供程序与驱动器</a>」</li>\n<li>弱类型、一切皆字符串的对照世界 → 见跨库「<a href=\"../../shell-scripting/bash-fundamentals/variables-and-types\">Shell 变量与类型</a>」</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"变量与类型","id":"变量与类型"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：变量是 .NET 对象的具名引用","id":"核心概念-变量是-net-对象的具名引用"},{"level":2,"text":"强类型约束：类型字面量","id":"强类型约束-类型字面量"},{"level":2,"text":"自动类型转换与字节量后缀","id":"自动类型转换与字节量后缀"},{"level":2,"text":"类型加速器：.NET 类型的简写","id":"类型加速器-net-类型的简写"},{"level":2,"text":"作用域：变量在何处可见","id":"作用域-变量在何处可见"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":3,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨链接"}],"prev":{"title":"提供程序与驱动器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/powershell-automation/foundations/providers-drives"},"next":{"title":"函数与脚本","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/powershell-automation/language/functions-scripts"}}